for i,(title,explanation,code) in enumerate(runsteps,1):body+=f'<section class="step" id="run-step-{i}"><span class="number">{i:02}</span><h2>{title}</h2><p>{explanation}</p>'+snippet(code,'powershell')+'</section>'
body+='<section class="step"><h2>Your .env configuration</h2>'+snippet(env,'dotenv')+'<p>Only your model key is required. Keep it local and restart after edits. Existing shell variables take precedence.</p></section><section class="note"><h3>Troubleshooting</h3><p>Use Node 24+, API credit and a supported model. Configure Git Bash on Windows if requested. If the port is occupied, use the printed existing-app URL or change PORT. Answer within two minutes or cancel. Missing option previews are not replaced by invented mockups. Other text belongs in a question answer; a general response is a separate reply. If a model does not ask as requested, inspect the actual SDK events before retrying.</p></section>'
